msgid "ability.trait_appliance.desc"
msgstr "Appliance attacks inflict Static at 2 units and Burn at 3. When you press Ready, Appliances cleanse those Negative Effects. At 4 units, they reflect incoming Static and Burn to the source. At 5 units, each attempted Static stack grants +1 PWR and each attempted Burn stack grants +1 HP."

msgid "ability.trait_costume.desc"
