msgid "ability.trait_mecha.desc"
msgstr "At 2 Mecha units, Mechas gain 1 Spikes when you press Ready. At 3, they also gain 1 Armor and inflict Static when attacking and when their Armor absorbs damage. At 4, Mechas fire a laser when allied units merge. At 5, when an allied Mecha is knocked out, surviving Mechas gain 2 Armor and 2 Spikes and fire lasers."

msgid "ability.trait_mercenary.bronze.desc"
msgstr "Whenever Gold is earned, the allied unit with the lowest current HP gains +1 HP."

