msgid "ability.trait_novice.pre_combat.desc"
msgstr "When you press Ready, you gain 1 Gold for every 2 Current Tokens held if your Lineup has at least 3 Novices. If your Lineup has at least 4 Novices, all Novice units in your Lineup also gain that much Armor. If it has at least 5 Novices, they also gain that much Spikes."

