msgid "tutorial.battle_management"
msgstr "Get Capsules. Use your Tokens on the Gacha Machines to get new units and items! Each machine has a different cost per Tier. Every token counts!"

msgid "tutorial.battle_management_intro.title"
msgstr "Gacha Machines"

msgid "tutorial.btn.got_it"
msgstr "Got it!"

msgid "tutorial.btn.next"
msgstr "Next"

msgid "tutorial.equip"
msgstr "Choose your equipment wisely. Units have limited slots, and once an item is equipped, it cannot be removed. Every choice counts!"

msgid "tutorial.first_draw.title"
msgstr "Building your Lineup"

msgid "tutorial.first_draw_1"
msgstr "Acquired capsules go to your Shelf. From there, you can place units in your Lineup or equip and use items. If the Shelf is full, new capsules go straight to the Discard."

msgid "tutorial.first_draw_2"
msgstr "The turn order is determined by the slot the units occupy, starting with the first slot on the enemy side and alternating slot by slot (occupied or not) between the sides. This means units closer to the front act earlier. The battle ends when all units on one side or the Hero are knocked out! Press \"Ready!\" when you are satisfied with your Lineup."

msgid "tutorial.first_draw_combat.title"
msgstr "Battle Rules"

msgid "tutorial.gacha_inspect_battle"
msgstr "Changes to your inventory or units that happen on the battlefield do not affect your collection!"

msgid "tutorial.gacha_inspect_battle.title"
msgstr "Battle Capsules"

msgid "tutorial.gacha_inspect_run.mouse"
msgstr "Gacha Collection: This is your current collection. Hover over a GachaBall to inspect it!"

msgid "tutorial.gacha_inspect_run.title"
msgstr "Gacha Collection"

msgid "tutorial.gacha_inspect_run.touch"
msgstr "Gacha Collection: This is your current collection. Press and hold a GachaBall to inspect it!"

msgid "tutorial.gambling_den"
msgstr "Risk it all for gold. Earn tokens from the challenge to spend on these machines for immediate gold rewards."

msgid "tutorial.loadout"
msgstr "Choose your hero and flashcard deck. Heroes have special abilities that can change drastically how the game plays and the deck is the flashcard deck that will be used throughout the entire run."

msgid "tutorial.merge_choice"
msgstr "Choose Merge to combine two into a single, more powerful entity, or Swap to reorganize your ranks? The choice is yours."

msgid "tutorial.new_card_intro"
msgstr "After every Challenge (or every streak of 3 correct answers), a new flashcard enters your Active Deck. This screen shows your newly added card and the flashcards with the lowest current mastery for you to review before the Challenge. Memorize a few because your tokens for this turn depend on it!"

msgid "tutorial.new_card_intro.title"
msgstr "New Flashcard and Review"

msgid "tutorial.path_choice_1"
msgstr "Choose your next Destination! Each Destination counts as a day and your enemies get stronger each day! Keep progressing to win!"

msgid "tutorial.path_choice_intro.title"
msgstr "Path Choice"

msgid "tutorial.rest_site"
msgstr "A moment of respite. Master the flashcard challenge to earn tokens, then spend them on these machines for permanent Hero upgrades."

msgid "tutorial.shop"
msgstr "Spend Gold to expand your collection. Reroll the stock if you're looking for something specific, but be warned: the price rises with every roll!"

msgid "tutorial.shrine_intro"
msgstr "The Shrine lets you shape your Gacha Collection for this run.\n\nRemove a capsule to take it out of your current collection for the rest of the run.\nRemoval costs 5 gold and increases by 1 each time for the rest of the run.\n\nTransform a capsule into a different random capsule of the same tier.\nTransforming always costs 5 gold and does not increase."

msgid "tutorial.shrine_intro.title"
msgstr "Removing and Transforming"

msgid "tutorial.training_grounds"
msgstr "A place to hone your hero's power. Earn tokens from the challenge to spend on these machines for permanent Power upgrades."

msgid "tutorial.traits"
msgstr "Lineups with units of the same Trait can activate Synergies that grant special effects and buffs if you have obtained the Crest or trinkets that affect that Trait. Hover over units to inspect and discover their Traits!"

msgid "tutorial.traits.mouse"
msgstr "Lineups with units of the same Trait can activate Synergies that grant special effects and buffs if you have obtained the Crest or trinkets that affect that Trait. Hover over units to inspect and discover their Traits!"

msgid "tutorial.traits.touch"
msgstr "Lineups with units of the same Trait can activate Synergies that grant special effects and buffs if you have obtained the Crest or trinkets that affect that Trait. Press and hold to inspect units and find out their Traits!"

msgid "tutorial.traits.title"
msgstr "Traits and Synergies"

