msgid "unit_dust_elite_t1.desc"
msgstr "At the end of each turn, summon units to fill empty team slots. Spawns a T1 Dust unit when an Ally is knocked out. Gains HP and PWR based on the tier of any Dust unit that is knocked out (e.g., +1/+1 for T1, +2/+2 for T2). Spawns a Dust unit at the start of each turn. Spawns a Dust unit when Attacking."

msgid "unit_dust_elite_t1.name"
msgstr "Dust Guard (T1)"

msgid "unit_dust_elite_t2.desc"
msgstr "At the end of each turn, summon units to fill empty team slots. Spawns a random T1 or T2 Dust unit when an Ally is knocked out. Gains HP and PWR based on the tier of any Dust unit that is knocked out (e.g., +1/+1 for T1, +2/+2 for T2). Spawns a Dust unit in the player's inventory."

msgid "unit_dust_elite_t2.name"
msgstr "Dust Sentinel (T2)"

msgid "unit_dust_elite_t3.desc"
msgstr "At the end of each turn, summon units to fill empty team slots. Spawns a random T1, T2 or T3 Dust unit when an Ally is knocked out. Gains HP and PWR based on the tier of any Dust unit that is knocked out (e.g., +1/+1 for T1, +2/+2 for T2)."

msgid "unit_dust_elite_t3.name"
msgstr "Dust Overlord (T3)"

msgid "unit_dust_t1.desc"
msgstr "When this unit enters the Lineup, it gains 1 Burn and 1 Static."

msgid "unit_dust_t1.name"
msgstr "Dust Minion (T1)"

msgid "unit_dust_t2.desc"
msgstr "When this unit enters the Lineup, it gains 2 Burn and 2 Static."

msgid "unit_dust_t2.name"
msgstr "Dust Minion (T2)"

msgid "unit_dust_t3.desc"
msgstr "When this unit enters the Lineup, it gains 3 Burn and 3 Static."

msgid "unit_dust_t3.name"
msgstr "Dust Minion (T3)"

msgid "boss_dustmon.name"
msgstr "Dustmon"

msgid "boss_dustmon.desc"
msgstr "The sovereign ruler of dust. Adds dust minions in the player's gacha machines, feasts on fallen allies, grows when dust minions merge, and gains power from all dust in existence."

msgid "boss_toughmon.name"
msgstr "Toughmon"

msgid "boss_toughmon.desc"
msgstr "The armored bastion commander. Hardens itself with armor from living allies and commands frontline troops with armor and spikes."

msgid "boss_doppelkun.name"
msgstr "Doppelkun"

msgid "boss_doppelkun.desc"
msgstr "The elusive mirror entity. Reflects the true strength of the opposing Hero upon entering battle."

msgid "elite_slimeblob.name"
msgstr "Slimeblob"

msgid "elite_slimeblob.desc"
msgstr "[color=#ffd166][b]When Taking Damage[/b][/color], if it is not knocked out, summons a Level 1 Spikeslime into the first empty slot."

msgid "elite_burnie.name"
msgstr "Burnie"

msgid "elite_burnie.desc"
msgstr "A raging flame elemental. Deals bonus damage equal to target's Burn stacks and ignites battlefield slots."

msgid "unit_spikeslime.name"
msgstr "Spikeslime"

msgid "unit_spikeslime.desc"
msgstr "A spiky slime minion. Enters battle bristling with sharp thorns."

msgid "trinket.banner_lone_whale.name"
msgstr "Banner: Lone Whale"

msgid "trinket.banner_lone_whale.desc"
msgstr "Deploys a single colossal Soliwhale in Slot 0 with massive stats, drawing immense power from empty allied slots. Reinforcements are completely disabled."

msgid "trinket.banner_swarm.name"
msgstr "Banner: Swarm"

msgid "trinket.banner_swarm.desc"
msgstr "Floods all lineup slots with inexpensive units, prioritizing maximum board saturation over raw tiers. At the end of each odd-numbered turn, calls in wave reinforcements to replenish any fallen ranks."

msgid "trinket.banner_fire_phalanx.name"
msgstr "Fire Banner"

msgid "trinket.banner_fire_phalanx.desc"
msgstr "An aggressive frontline anchored by Fire and Mecha synergies, spreading Burn and retaliating on hit. At the end of each odd-numbered turn, summons Fire reinforcements and tactical allies equipped with Fire Emblems."

msgid "trinket.banner_dustmon.name"
msgstr "Banner: Dustmon"

msgid "trinket.banner_dustmon.desc"
msgstr "Dustmon commands from the backline while waves of reinforcements fill the front ranks, triggering its resonance and stat growth each time an ally is knocked out. Summons reinforcements at the end of each odd-numbered turn."

msgid "trinket.banner_toughmon.name"
msgstr "Banner: Toughmon"

msgid "trinket.banner_toughmon.desc"
msgstr "Toughmon fortifies the backline behind an impenetrable phalanx of heavy Tanks equipped with defensive gear, sharing innate Tank trait synergies. Summons heavy Tank reinforcements at the end of each odd-numbered turn."

msgid "trinket.banner_doppelkun.name"
msgstr "Banner: Doppelkun"

msgid "trinket.banner_doppelkun.desc"
msgstr "Doppelkun leads from the front, flanked exclusively by shape-shifting Mimicloaks that mirror opposing player units at the start of each turn. Summons replacement Mimicloaks at the end of each odd-numbered turn."

msgid "trinket.banner_slimeblob.name"
msgstr "Banner: Slimeblob"

msgid "trinket.banner_slimeblob.desc"
msgstr "Slimeblob's gelatinous banner. At the start of each turn, summons a Level 1 Spikeslime into the first empty slot. If all slots are full, levels up the first non-max Spikeslime from front to back. If all Spikeslimes are max level, heals the front Spikeslime for 3 HP and grants it +2 Spikes."

msgid "trinket.banner_burnie.name"
msgstr "Banner: Burnie"

msgid "trinket.banner_burnie.desc"
msgstr "Burnie's blazing vanguard. Grants the Fire Trait Crest for free, surrounding Burnie with synergized Fire units that spread Burn and explode when knocked out. Summons Fire reinforcements at the end of each odd-numbered turn."

msgid "ability.dustmon_spore.desc"
msgstr "When an ally is knocked out, heals HP equal to their tier and adds a dust minion in the player's gacha machines."

msgid "ability.dustmon_merge.desc"
msgstr "When dust minions merge, adds a dust minion in the player's gacha machines and gains 1 HP and 1 PWR."

msgid "ability.dustmon_vampiric.desc"
msgstr "When an ally is knocked out, heals HP equal to the fallen ally's tier."

msgid "ability.dustmon_resonance.desc"
msgstr "Gains +1 PWR for every Dust unit in existence across all player containers."

msgid "ability.dust_enter_board.desc"
msgstr "When this unit enters the Lineup, it gains 1 Burn and 1 Static."

msgid "ability.dust_t2_enter_board.desc"
msgstr "When this unit enters the Lineup, it gains 2 Burn and 2 Static."

msgid "ability.dust_t3_enter_board.desc"
msgstr "When this unit enters the Lineup, it gains 3 Burn and 3 Static."

msgid "ability.toughmon_command.desc"
msgstr "At the start of each turn, gains Armor for surviving allies and commands frontline allies with +2 Armor and +1 Spikes."

msgid "ability.doppelkun_mirror.desc"
msgstr "When you press Ready, this unit mirrors the enemy Hero's current HP and PWR."

msgid "ability.slimeblob_mitosis.desc"
msgstr "[color=#ffd166][b]When Taking Damage[/b][/color], if it is not knocked out, summons a Level 1 Spikeslime into the first empty slot."

msgid "ability.slimeblob_evolution.desc"
msgstr "At the start of each turn, summons a Level 1 Spikeslime into the first empty slot. If all slots are full, levels up the first non-max Spikeslime from front to back. If all Spikeslimes are max level, heals the front Spikeslime for 3 HP and grants it +2 Spikes."

msgid "ability.burnie_attack.desc"
msgstr "Attacks deal bonus damage equal to target's Burn stacks and ignite the target's slot into a Burn slot."

msgid "ability.banner_reinforce.desc"
msgstr "At the end of each odd-numbered turn, calls in tactical wave reinforcements."

msgid "trinket.banner_earth.name"
msgstr "Earth Banner"

msgid "trinket.banner_earth.desc"
msgstr "A resilient frontline uses healing to sustain Earth Armor and Spikes. Grants the Earth Crest for free. Approved off-trait partners receive free Earth Emblems. At the end of each odd-numbered turn, calls in reinforcements to repair its formation."

msgid "trinket.banner_water.name"
msgstr "Water Banner"

msgid "trinket.banner_water.desc"
msgstr "Positional healing and cleansing sustain allies whose abilities activate when healed. Grants the Water Crest for free. Approved off-trait partners receive free Water Emblems. At the end of each odd-numbered turn, calls in reinforcements to repair its formation."

msgid "trinket.banner_air.name"
msgstr "Air Banner"

msgid "trinket.banner_air.desc"
msgstr "Directional PWR transfers and ranged pressure help knock out enemies carrying Static. Grants the Air Crest for free. Approved off-Trait partners receive free Air Emblems. At the end of each odd-numbered turn, calls in reinforcements to repair its formation."

msgid "trinket.banner_tank.name"
msgstr "Tank Banner"

msgid "trinket.banner_tank.desc"
msgstr "Healing sustains an armored formation built around Armor passing and interception. Grants the Tank Crest for free. Approved off-trait partners receive free Tank Emblems. At the end of each odd-numbered turn, calls in reinforcements to repair its formation."

msgid "trinket.banner_fighter.name"
msgstr "Fighter Banner"

msgid "trinket.banner_fighter.desc"
msgstr "Knocked-out allies feed PWR and growth for aggressive Fighters. Grants the Fighter Crest for free. Approved off-Trait partners receive free Fighter Emblems. At the end of each odd-numbered turn, calls in reinforcements to repair its formation."

msgid "trinket.banner_support.name"
msgstr "Support Banner"

msgid "trinket.banner_support.desc"
msgstr "Positional stat buffs, summon support, and adjacent buff copying build a growing team. Grants the Support Crest for free. Approved off-trait partners receive free Support Emblems. At the end of each odd-numbered turn, calls in reinforcements to repair its formation."

msgid "trinket.banner_plant.name"
msgstr "Plant Banner"

msgid "trinket.banner_plant.desc"
msgstr "Repeated healing keeps a Plant frontline alive while it accumulates Spikes. Grants the Plant Crest for free. Approved off-trait partners receive free Plant Emblems. At the end of each odd-numbered turn, calls in reinforcements to repair its formation."

msgid "trinket.banner_food.name"
msgstr "Food Banner"

msgid "trinket.banner_food.desc"
msgstr "Hurt Food units heal the ally behind, activating healing abilities and feeding stat growth. Grants the Food Crest for free. Approved off-trait partners receive free Food Emblems. At the end of each odd-numbered turn, calls in reinforcements to repair its formation."

msgid "trinket.banner_animal.name"
msgstr "Animal Banner"

msgid "trinket.banner_animal.desc"
msgstr "Animal attack healing activates allied Armor, Spikes, or Burn abilities. Grants the Animal Crest for free. Approved off-trait partners receive free Animal Emblems. At the end of each odd-numbered turn, calls in reinforcements to repair its formation."

msgid "trinket.banner_mecha.name"
msgstr "Mecha Banner"

msgid "trinket.banner_mecha.desc"
msgstr "Armored Mechas inflict Static and support an attrition engine of summons and revenge. Grants the Mecha Crest for free. Approved off-trait partners receive free Mecha Emblems. At the end of each odd-numbered turn, calls in reinforcements to repair its formation."

msgid "trinket.banner_toy.name"
msgstr "Toy Banner"

msgid "trinket.banner_toy.desc"
msgstr "Replacement bodies and summon support prolong a formation that punishes melee contact with Static. Grants the Toy Crest for free. Approved off-trait partners receive free Toy Emblems. At the end of each odd-numbered turn, calls in reinforcements to repair its formation."

msgid "trinket.banner_appliance.name"
msgstr "Appliance Banner"

msgid "trinket.banner_appliance.desc"
msgstr "Durable Appliances use healing and protection while countering Burn and Static. Grants the Appliance Crest for free. Approved off-trait partners receive free Appliance Emblems. At the end of each odd-numbered turn, calls in reinforcements to repair its formation."

msgid "trinket.banner_costume.name"
msgstr "Costume Banner"

msgid "trinket.banner_costume.desc"
msgstr "Theft when you press Ready and PWR transfers when units are knocked out empower a growing backline carry. Grants the Costume Crest for free. Approved off-Trait partners receive free Costume Emblems. At the end of each odd-numbered turn, calls in reinforcements to repair its formation."

msgid "ui.battle_order"
msgstr "Order"

msgid "ui.battle_preview"
msgstr "Preview"

msgid "item.incubator.name"
msgstr "Incubator"

msgid "item.incubator.desc"
msgstr "Move an allied Lineup unit into this capsule on the Shelf. It gains +1 HP and +1 PWR at the start of each turn it spends inside and keeps the bonus when deployed. Returning it to the Lineup sends the Incubator to Discard."

msgid "item.encounter_tonic.name"
msgstr "Fortifying Tonic"

msgid "item.encounter_tonic.desc"
msgstr "Give a unit in the Lineup +3 HP and +2 PWR for this encounter."

msgid "item.damage_vial.name"
msgstr "Impact Vial"

msgid "item.damage_vial.desc"
msgstr "Deal 5 damage to the chosen unit in either Lineup. Armor reduces this damage."

